    "### 1. Windows Installation (PowerShell / WinGet)\n",
    "```powershell\n",
    "# Standalone installer via PowerShell\n",
    "powershell -c \"irm https://astral.sh/uv/install.ps1 | iex\"\n",
    "\n",
    "# Or via Windows Package Manager\n",
    "winget install --id Astral-sh.uv\n",
    "```"
